          <p class="text-sm font-medium text-ink mb-1">Disclaimer</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-body leading-relaxed max-w-3xl">
            This calculator provides estimates only. Calculations are based on <strong>UAE Federal Decree-Law No.&nbsp;33 of 2021 (Labour Law), Article&nbsp;51</strong>. Results may differ from actual entitlements due to date rounding, specific contract terms, or legal interpretations. This tool does not constitute legal advice. For binding determinations, consult a UAE-qualified employment lawyer or the Ministry of Human Resources and Emiratisation (MOHRE).
          </p>
        </div>
